{"id": "clm:d08e791c12265bff79de6ec0ca0fee42fafcb0f2e5c1c865aeb416e1beec442f", "type": "statement", "text": "MPC MarketPlace’s FAQ states a $100.00 accumulated-royalty payment threshold assessed by the first of each month, with below-threshold royalties carried over to the next month’s earnings. It states that sales commissions are paid only in US Dollars. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-11-06)", "source_url": "https://www.makeplayingcards.com/marketplace/faq-marketplace.aspx", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Print-on-demand game manufacturing and fulfillment"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:fbd6e4a8e903ba46f631eb78735958c7ac6ebed677b545bb9f281da1c854e67a", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:5a132f214a31cab8a22a03fbadcf4cfea0f925f4f1e0d3322cb3d15db448ec80", "ev:6bd32cac57e5b5d30e8ef38805188692bb2f7c7d06687f7c1a9b0d996e2bc370", "ev:adcd514ac4b06556e1603eabc455e2265b01ada2fa2046bbf7e318d23bcbc0af"]}
